( TRUSS-DIAGRAM-THERMAL: group_truss_elasti_elongation_force_diagram uses the
  mechanical strain, the total strain minus the thermal strain alpha dT
  {owner 2026-11-23}. Truss length 2, diagram -0.01 -20 0 0 0.01 10 0.02 15,
  elongation 0.028 {total strain 0.014}, group_truss_expansion 1e-3 and
  dT +10 {thermal strain 0.01}: strain 0.004, force 4. The Professional
  02-08-2026 enters the diagram with the total strain: force 12.
  Deliberate divergence. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
condif_temperature
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0.
node 2 2.
element 1 -truss 1 2
group_type 0 -truss
group_truss_area 0 1.
group_truss_expansion 0 0.001
group_truss_elasti_young 0 100.
group_truss_initial_force 0 3.
group_truss_elasti_elongation_force_diagram 0 -0.01 -20 0 0 0.01 10 0.02 15
bounda_dof 1 1 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx
bounda_time 2 0.028
bounda_dof 3 -ra 1 2 -ra -temp
bounda_time 3 0. 0. 1. 10. 2. 10.
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
target_item 1 -element_truss_force 1 0
target_value 1 4. 1.e-8
end_data
